              ~ ~ / / / / / / / / / / / / / / / / /
              ~ ~ / / / / / / / / / / / / / / / / /
              ~ ~ / / / / / / / / / / / / / / / / /

  . safe   / too steep   ~ water   T trees   P person   ? unsure   (blank) not seen
