  t=64 s: The Effect Ethos withdrew the patch at 34 m across and 434 m along: a gust could put the drone on steep ground beside it. Choosing again.
  t=64 s: 24 proposals put to the Effect Ethos under the contingency norms: 2 permitted.
  t=64 s:   4 forbidden: a gust could put the drone on steep ground beside it.
